#: src/launcher/main.cpp:133
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This AppImage has not been integrated yet.\n"
"\n"
"%1\n"
"\n"
"What would you like to do?"
msgstr ""
"このAppImageはまだ統合されていません。\n"
"\n"
"%1\n"
"\n"
"どうしますか？"

#: src/launcher/main.cpp:136
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<b>Integrate and Run</b> — move the AppImage to %1 and add it to the "
"application menu.\n"
"<b>Run Once</b> — just launch the AppImage now without moving or modifying "
"it."
msgstr ""
"<b>統合して実行</b> — AppImageを%1に移動し、アプリケーションメニューに追加します。\n"
"<b>一度だけ実行</b> — 移動や変更せずに今すぐAppImageを起動します。"

#: src/launcher/main.cpp:140
msgid "Integrate and Run"
msgstr "統合して実行"

#: src/launcher/main.cpp:141
msgid "Run Once"
msgstr "一度だけ実行"

#: src/launcher/main.cpp:154
msgid "Failed to integrate %1."
msgstr "%1 の統合に失敗しました。"

#: src/core/miryu.cpp:195
msgid "Warning"
msgstr "警告"

#: src/core/miryu.cpp:196
msgid ""
"An AppImage with the same name has already been integrated.\n"
"\n"
"Do you want to overwrite it? (Choosing No will run the AppImage once.)"
msgstr ""
"同じ名前のAppImageが既に統合されています。\n"
"\n"
"上書きしますか？（「いいえ」を選択すると、一度だけ実行されます。）"

